<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh Jesus, Master, to the door post now bring me.</l><l>Open my ears to hear, Your voice and all that You say to me.</l><l>Oh Jesus, Master, I will obey willingly.</l><l>To love and serve Him all my life, this my plea!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
